# Files kept in the repository but not needed by the deployed site.
#
# The site links to exactly five PDFs: pdf/docs/*.pdf (the four case-study
# documents) and pdf/Steve-Jung-Resume.pdf. Everything under pdf/Case */ is
# the original source archive, so shipping it only inflated the deployment.
# Add a document to pdf/docs/ before linking it, or it will 404 in production.
pdf/Case*

# Generator inputs for the image asset manager artifact (thumbnail data and
# its build script) — never requested by a page.
tools/
